# Post-push: close dev servers

Immediately after a successful `git push` (or when the user is done testing), terminate every local dev process this session started:

- `npm run dev` / Vite (`:5173`)
- `vite preview` (`:4173`)
- any other architecture/preview servers

Kill the process and free the port. Do not leave a background Vite running after push.

This overrides the pre-commit “restart Vite so the version badge updates” step: bump the version for the commit, but **after push, always shut the servers down**.
